          "text_after_clauses": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "3",
          "id": "465-3",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "The amount of penalty shall not exceed the amount of tax deductible or collectible for failures in relation to the following:—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "465-3-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "a declaration required under section 393(7);",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-465-3-a-001",
                  "target_id": "393-7",
                  "target_type": "subsection",
                  "anchor_text": "section 393(7)",
                  "relationship": "depends_on",
                  "confidence": "medium"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "465-3-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "a certificate as required under section 395(4); and",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-465-3-b-001",
                  "target_id": "395-4",
                  "target_type": "subsection",
                  "anchor_text": "section 395(4)",
                  "relationship": "depends_on",
                  "confidence": "medium"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "c",
              "id": "465-3-c",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 430.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "statements under section 397(3)(b) or (e).",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-465-3-c-001",
                  "target_id": "397-3-b",
                  "target_type": "clause",
                  "anchor_text": "section 397(3)(b) or (e)",
                  "relationship": "depends_on",
                  "confidence": "medium"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "4",
          "id": "465-4",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Any penalty imposable under sub-section (1) or (2) shall be imposed—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "465-4-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "if the contravention, failure or default for which such penalty is imposable occurs in the course of any proceeding before an income-tax authority not below the rank of Joint Director or a Joint Commissioner, by such income-tax authority;",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "465-4-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "in a case falling under sub-section (1)(d), by the income-tax authority who had issued the notice or direction referred to therein;",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-465-4-b-001",
                  "target_id": "465-1-d",
                  "target_type": "clause",
                  "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)(d)",
                  "relationship": "depends_on",
                  "confidence": "high"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "c",
              "id": "465-4-c",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 430.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "in a case falling under sub-section (2)(f), by the Principal Chief Commissioner or Chief Commissioner or Principal Commissioner or Commissioner; and",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-465-4-c-001",
                  "target_id": "465-2-f",
                  "target_type": "clause",
                  "anchor_text": "sub-section (2)(f)",
                  "relationship": "depends_on",
                  "confidence": "high"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "d",
              "id": "465-4-d",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 450.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "in any other case, by the Joint Director or the Joint Commissioner. (5) In this section, \"income-tax authority\" includes a Principal Director General or Director General, Principal Director or Director, Joint Director and an Assistant Director or Deputy Director while exercising the powers vested in a court under the Code of Civil Procedure, 1908 (5 of 1908), when trying a suit in respect of the matters specified in section 246(1).",
              "children": [],
